      <title>Trio Mediæval: "Folk Songs"</title>
      <link>https://urbanmilwaukee.com/2026/01/13/sponsored-trio-mediaeval-5/</link>
      <description>Norwegian and Scandinavian folk songs were a part of daily events and special occasions throughout history. The program features a selection of love songs, wedding tunes, lullabies, and instrumental dances. Most intriguing are the Medieval ballads that recount tales of nobles, knights, and maidens. There will be a pre-concert lecture at 4:00. The approximate program length is 1 hour 45 minutes, including intermission. See the "39th Season" page on our website for parking details.</description>
